- Product: {input.product_name}
- Brand: {input.brand_name}
- Budget tier: {input.budget}
- Target platforms: {input.target_platforms}
- Style variants: {input.style_variants}
- Target audience: {input.target_audience}

## Your Task
Create a complete shoot plan. For each shot, define:
- **shot_id**: unique identifier (e.g. "ig-story-minimalist-1")
- **platform**: target platform
- **aspect**: aspect ratio (9:16 for Stories/Reels/TikTok/Pinterest, 4:5 for Feed, 1:1 for Twitter)
- **style**: visual style variant
- **scene_description**: detailed scene/environment description
- **model_description**: person description if applicable (age, appearance, outfit, pose) - always include "natural skin with realistic texture, visible pores" for realism
- **product_placement**: exactly how the product appears in the shot
- **props**: list of props in the scene
- **lighting**: lighting setup description
- **camera**: lens mm, aperture, focus point
- **mood**: emotional tone
- **caption_hook**: suggested social media caption hook (first line)

## Platform specs
- Instagram Stories: 9:16, vertical, bold, swipe-up friendly
- Instagram Feed: 4:5, editorial, scroll-stopping
- TikTok: 9:16, authentic, trend-aware, raw energy
- Pinterest: 2:3, aspirational, pin-worthy, detailed
- Twitter/X: 16:9, clean, high-contrast

## Shot count by budget
- **full**: 3-4 shots per platform x style combination (12-18 total)
- **standard**: 2 shots per platform x style combination (6-8 total)
- **lean**: 1 shot per platform, best style only (3 total)

{% if input.budget == "full" %}
Include shots for ALL requested platforms and ALL style variants.
{% elif input.budget == "standard" %}
Prioritize the top 2-3 platform/style combinations. Focus on highest-impact shots.
{% else %}
Pick the 3 highest-impact platform/shot combinations only. One per platform.
{% endif %}

