{% if steps.brand-memory-recall.output.brand_known %}
This is a returning brand. Lean into styles that scored well previously: {steps.brand-memory-recall.output.best_styles}
Avoid compositions that underperformed.
{% else %}
First-time brand - create a diverse mix to establish baseline data.
{% endif %}

